// Project-owned Cattan extension for Module Expansion's Captain's Mate.
{1}{Captain's below, seeing to the charts. Are you bound inland, or do you want passage back to Tarant?}{Captain's below, seeing to the charts. Are you bound inland, or do you want passage back to Tarant?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{Take me inland to Plainwicke Plantation.}{}{1}{}{-10}{ }
{3}{Return to Tarant.}{}{1}{}{-20}{ }
{4}{I'll stay at the harbor for now.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{10}{Aye. A wagon makes for Plainwicke from the end of the quay. I'll see you aboard.}{Aye. A wagon makes for Plainwicke from the end of the quay. I'll see you aboard.}{}{}{}{ }
{20}{Back to Tarant, then. The captain will sail when the tide turns.}{Back to Tarant, then. The captain will sail when the tide turns.}{}{}{}{ }
